STATEMENT: >>>
The GSSC Website Member Frontend SHALL let a member with the necessary permissions modify a section of a public page, including publication sections, without programming knowledge.
<<<
RATIONALE: >>>
Authorized members keep public page sections current without developer intervention. Publications are included as sections of public pages. The Page/Section Content Editor hosts section field edits for those members.
