STATEMENT: >>>
The GSSC Website Member Frontend SHALL provide a members sitemap page that presents the full Members site tree.
<<<
RATIONALE: >>>
No Member Frontend PIR requires a sitemap page. Presenting the full Members site tree on a dedicated page gives logged-in members an accessibility-oriented listing of members destinations beyond the Header Navigation Menu. This requirement does not set tree labels or nesting depth.
