[[SECTION]]
UID: GSSC-MHLR-COLOR-MODE
TITLE: Color Mode

[REQUIREMENT]
UID: GSSC-MHLR-105
TITLE: Color Mode
STATEMENT: >>>
The GSSC Website Member Frontend SHALL present the members site in either a light or a dark color mode according to the member's stored preference, and SHALL default to light mode when no preference is stored.
<<<
RATIONALE: >>>
No Member Frontend PIR requires color modes. Members need a durable light or dark presentation built from organization palette tokens so chrome and content remain readable, including beside the official society logo.
<<<
DERIVED: True
CHANGE_DRIVER: GSSC5-125
REVIEW_STATUS: Approved

[REQUIREMENT]
UID: GSSC-MHLR-106
TITLE: Header Theme Toggle
STATEMENT: >>>
The GSSC Website Member Frontend Header SHALL present a Theme Toggle that switches the active members color mode between light and dark and stores that preference for later visits.
<<<
RATIONALE: >>>
Color Mode needs a Header control so members can change and persist light or dark presentation without leaving the members shell.
<<<
DERIVED: True
CHANGE_DRIVER: GSSC5-125
REVIEW_STATUS: Approved

