STATEMENT: >>>
The GSSC Website Member Frontend SHALL present the newsletter issue as a file upload control, upload a chosen issue file to the Unified Backend newsletters store for that newsletter's cuid, and replace any prior issue file for that newsletter when a new file is uploaded on edit.
